{"inkVersion":21,"root":[[{"->":"talk"},["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"talk":["^Is everything alright? ","#","^speaker: Detective","/#","\n","^Hah. About as much as it can be I suppose. ","#","^speaker: Worker Lady","/#","\n","^What seems to be the problem? ","#","^speaker: Detective","/#","\n","^That’s very kind of you, but I don’t really know what anyone could do about this. ","#","^speaker: Worker Lady","/#","\n","^I was supposed to get a delivery ages ago. I’ve done just about all I can do without it and I don’t know where it could be. I really can’t afford to miss it too, so all that’s left for me to do is wait. ","#","^speaker: Worker Lady","/#","\n","^What kind of delivery? ","#","^speaker: Rie","/#","\n","^Just some energy. ","#","^speaker: Worker Lady","/#","\n","^You’d think with there being less of us there’d be more than enough to go around, but things are still tight as ever. ","#","^speaker: Worker Lady","/#","\n","^Would it help any if we found the delivery? ","#","^speaker: Detective","/#","\n","^It sure would! ","#","^speaker: Worker Lady","/#","\n","^If only you could... ","#","^speaker: Worker Lady","/#","\n","^We can. ","#","^speaker: Detective","/#","\n","^We can? ","#","^speaker: Rie","/#","\n","^I'm sure of it. ","#","^speaker: Detective","/#","\n","^Well I'd really appreciate it. ","#","^speaker: Worker Lady","/#","\n","^You folks do look busy, so make sure not to go too far out of your way. ","#","^speaker: Worker Lady","/#","\n","^It'll be no trouble at all! ","#","^speaker: Detective","/#","\n","^...","\n","^It'll be one trouble at all! ","#","^speaker: Detective","/#","\n","^And that'd be? ","#","^speaker: Worker Lady","/#","\n","^Introductions! ","#","^speaker: Detective","/#","\n","^I'm the Detective, and this is Rie. ","#","^speaker: Detective","/#","\n","^Nice to meet you. ","#","^speaker: Rie","/#","\n","^You can call me Bo. ","#","^speaker: Bo","/#","\n","^Then, Bo, we're on the case! ","#","^speaker: Detective","/#","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"global decl":["ev","str","^","/str",{"VAR=":"task_id"},0,{"VAR=":"task_state"},0,{"VAR=":"has_required_items"},0,{"VAR=":"has_required_objects"},"/ev","end",null],"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}